In the [tourism example](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/examples/tourism/), we solved that by doing:

```css
    .ais-range-slider--handle-lower {
      transform: translateX(-50%);
    }

    .ais-range-slider--handle-upper {
      transform: translateX(50%);
    }
```

I wonder if we should do that by default, thoughts?
